    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darkly satirical political sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops in first-person battles. Your choices shape society \u2014 and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/ba15f110c835a54190b7ad9fa1ebe2c2.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/b9e1ea024d0d54dc83ceee4a0186ee32.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mold your populace</strong> by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway citizens' Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Institute curfews, rationing, indoctrination centers, or public feasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Watch as policies spark gratitude\u2026 or rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Crush uprisings with propaganda, surveillance towers, mass rallies\u2014or brutal force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/b008e1ef18233a7b2f970895313631ba.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/567d2a70f5300119d34a6fd0fb133a3c.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Construct factories, housing, armories, and surveillance networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Automate production lines and resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Assign troops to mining, logistics, or police duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Dictate salaries, healthcare, housing density, and working conditions\u2014all with real consequences for morale, productivity, and dissent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/ee1e8e6243d723a6a861b87c888398d3.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/b9022773d71e1c64b3792cc3bf6198c4.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead roguelite FPS engagements\u00a0</strong>and galactic expeditions in one seamless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Arm your battalion with State-approved weapons and policy-driven abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Assault Urslan outposts, recover critical resources, and weaken their hive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Survive or suffer the consequences\u2014lost soldiers, wasted resources, and rebellion risk back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1964ba00d85a31b681b282adea0085ee.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pax Autocratica is a <strong>political sim</strong>, <strong>colony sim</strong>, and <strong>FPS roguelite</strong> hybrid. It combines <strong>base building</strong>, <strong>citizen management</strong>, and <strong>first-person tactical combat</strong> in a sci-fi dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Your decisions are recorded in the annals of history...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rule with compassion, cruelty\u2014or pragmatic brutality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your legacy is the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/02369de7275bfa4e9ef1bb0fed20ac26.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darkly satirical political sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops in first-person battles. Your choices shape society \u2014 and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/ba15f110c835a54190b7ad9fa1ebe2c2.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/b9e1ea024d0d54dc83ceee4a0186ee32.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mold your populace</strong> by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway citizens' Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Institute curfews, rationing, indoctrination centers, or public feasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Watch as policies spark gratitude\u2026 or rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Crush uprisings with propaganda, surveillance towers, mass rallies\u2014or brutal force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/b008e1ef18233a7b2f970895313631ba.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/567d2a70f5300119d34a6fd0fb133a3c.avif?t=1754298827\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Construct factories, housing, armories, and surveillance networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Automate production lines and resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Assign troops to mining, logistics, or police duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Dictate salaries, healthcare, housing density, and working condi